# Electric Vehicle Market Performance & Insights

## 📌 Project Overview
The **Electric Vehicle Market Performance & Insights** project is a comprehensive data analysis and visualization initiative built using Tableau Public. This project explores 200,000 records of global electric vehicle data across multiple parameters—including vehicle specifications, pricing, battery technologies, annual sales trends, customer ratings, and manufacturing countries.

